OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist vehicle arrives for
OL,4,Awoman with dwarfism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist vehicle has arrived in
OL,7,FJersey to help a woman with dwarfism
OL,8,Fget around.
OL,10,FThe vehicle arrived on Monday and
OL,11,FCaroline Fry is expected to be able to
OL,12,Fuse it after getting specialist lessons
OL,13,Fwith DriveAbility Jersey, which
OL,14,Fprovides driving instructions for the
OL,15,Flocal disabled community.
OL,17,FThe vehicle has arrived after Fry's
OL,18,Ffriend Jonathan Beaty managed to raise
OL,19,Fmore than #6,000 to help pay for it.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
