OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist vehicle arrives for
OL,4,Awoman with dwarfism
OL,5,
OL,6,FFry, who plans to use it along with a
OL,7,Fmobility scooter to remain independent,
OL,8,Fpreviously said such support had
OL,9,F"rapidly all contributed to get my
OL,10,Findependence back".
